        "title": "The table below shows employment patterns for males and females in New Zealand in 1993 and 2003. Summarize the information by selecting and reporting the main features and make comparisons where relevant.",
        "status": "published",
        "content_writing": "<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><em><strong>The table below shows employment patterns for males and females in New Zealand in 1993 and 2003. </strong></em></span><em style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Summarize the information by selecting and reporting the main features and make comparisons where relevant.</strong></em></p>",
        "order": 1,
        "instruction": "<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">HƯỚNG DẪN VIẾT B&Agrave;I</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><em>IELTS Writing Task 1 - Employment Patterns in New Zealand: 1993 vs 2003</em></p>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UQlGdpAaUoJFOsxWOYzlDAiUgDe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>1.</strong><strong> Idea cho Overview:</strong></span></h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N0nNdqrxtoU9EGxkGvml6QHzgzd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GWPNd7ft0oPRpuxfDGnl1aKWgoe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QxWPdDnfdod2NixZJAjlLYzqgGb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QEeEdHIN4ofkwNxCkILl0889gfh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Ood5dTvPNoqnHMxOOrHlbFmOgxf\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-F5xEdvXIaowy0GxL2a2lB2jfgid\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Ood5dTvPNoqnHMxOOrHlbFmOgxf\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SjmOdwvzzowAdLxFQUElrTUagrd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Ood5dTvPNoqnHMxOOrHlbFmOgxf\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-EpMydNSxHocPpcx8hb8lhqnrg1c\">\n<div>\n<div>Đ&acirc;y l&agrave; một đề b&agrave;i kh&oacute; v&igrave; 2 l&yacute; do:\n<div data-page-id=\"Ood5dTvPNoqnHMxOOrHlbFmOgxf\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Q4Q6djbZroAEgBx4M3rliFXggtf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Kh&oacute; để x&aacute;c định &yacute; nghĩa của c&aacute;c con số <em>(phần trăm của lực lượng lao động ở 2 giới t&iacute;nh tham gia v&agrave;o c&aacute;c lĩnh vực kh&aacute;c nhau trong từng năm)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-S01Ed0yoYotMSWx2MJElkO0zghh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Rất nhiều số liệu v&agrave; kh&oacute; đế nhận diện đặc điểm chung hoặc nh&oacute;m số liệu.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SSrLdI0H9oysztxzLTel6WjPgef\">\n<div>\n<div>Đối với đề Employment Patterns in New Zealand: 1993 vs 2003 n&agrave;y, <strong>team academic IELTS 1984</strong> chọn th&ocirc;ng tin dựa tr&ecirc;n <strong>trend</strong> (xu hướng) v&agrave; <strong>differences</strong> (sự kh&aacute;c biệt) <strong>ch&iacute;nh</strong> của dữ liệu để cho v&agrave;o Overview.</div>\n<div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-C778dnI4IoylzvxdohElTKOzgjg\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Trend: </strong>Ng&agrave;nh <strong>agriculture</strong> v&agrave; <strong>manufacturing</strong> &iacute;t phổ biến hơn, trong khi ng&agrave;nh <strong>business</strong> v&agrave; c&aacute;c ng&agrave;nh li&ecirc;n quan đến <strong>services</strong> th&igrave; c&oacute; lực lượng lao động nhiều hơn.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-S89sdvq1ooZBrrxt5relADllgnd\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Differences:</strong> Sau 10 năm, phần lớn c&aacute;c ng&agrave;nh c&oacute; <strong>sự c&acirc;n bằng hơn giữa 2 giới t&iacute;nh</strong>.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QxWPdDnfdod2NixZJAjlLYzqgGb\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TTLqda2f9ooxOTxsgKLlEoHXgHc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>2.</strong><strong> C&aacute;ch ph&acirc;n chia BODY:</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DQntd3hjzoNCjwxOfz4lvHOcgbb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N9LhdhEVXoJnGNxJPvyl0YZPg9e\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CRT6dLvfRoVbHtxCnc9l7AdygTl\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-KGfkdvXnMo9tBVxWubvlf0gagVh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TOoQd6oJTo25Hhxi84tlE4FPgnb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XibGdxfRGovZX4xmloNlYRnWgNh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Ood5dTvPNoqnHMxOOrHlbFmOgxf\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-F2aHdRosAoJyFhxEEwSlHZ0cgsb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Ood5dTvPNoqnHMxOOrHlbFmOgxf\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N3jndS9QIoiqpVxn5XOlqWIkgic\">\n<div>\n<div>\n<div data-page-id=\"Ood5dTvPNoqnHMxOOrHlbFmOgxf\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XfwsdF9JNojbO9xtktDlcGH5gtb\">\n<div>\n<div>Ở b&agrave;i n&agrave;y ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh ph&acirc;n BODY theo lĩnh vực:</div>\n<div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-E2QBdCUBjoGcBPxvS1JlEhTPgkS\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>BODY 1:</strong> Tả những ng&agrave;nh lớn nhất: <strong>services and transport</strong>, <strong>manufacturing</strong>, v&agrave; <strong>agriculture</strong>.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-V6NxdHcdko8TgTxv7talEonFgzf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>BODY 2: </strong>Tả những ng&agrave;nh c&ograve;n lại:<strong> business, building, </strong>v&agrave;<strong> social services.</strong></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>3.</strong><strong> C&aacute;ch viết từng c&acirc;u:</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WTQ0dwsgtot3Mux4ZXOl05hSgTH\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AmqcddMWAotWQFxJT6xl8CElghf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RKcrd7u17ogCsex6cUPlJ2cCgkh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JLrudDKQVoB78vxXmgzldmNBgLh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WmZmdTBuno2TMIx2y6zl9EQGgRd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Ood5dTvPNoqnHMxOOrHlbFmOgxf\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NcOkdRMB3oglFQx3YSslSvXpgbe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Ood5dTvPNoqnHMxOOrHlbFmOgxf\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VzPUdBpFmosYQyx4NFOl79YRgKh\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-APeudfcnGokeKfxzDvQl1ZTYg0b\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FLrHdc701owzfzxHR4Al2Nq3ggc\">\n<div data-lark-html-role=\"root\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Ood5dTvPNoqnHMxOOrHlbFmOgxf\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Not0dYrcDopz4GxMdj5lrUQrgwb\">\n<div>\n<h4><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>BODY 1: Những ng&agrave;nh lớn nhất: </strong></span></h4>\n<div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OYZjdc9Bfo61L6xitfhluV89gne\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>C&acirc;u 1:</strong> Ng&agrave;nh <strong>services and transport</strong> c&oacute; phần trăm lao động từ cả 2 giới lớn nhất cho phần lớn giai đoạn, với sự tham gia của nữ giới giảm từ một nửa c&ograve;n 36%, v&agrave; của nam tăng từ 22% l&ecirc;n 31%.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-A8psds9neoHjqjxz7czlrykygyg\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>C&acirc;u 2:</strong> Ng&agrave;nh quan trọng tiếp theo l&agrave; <strong>manufacturing</strong>, cung cấp việc l&agrave;m cho 1/4 v&agrave; 1/6 của nam v&agrave; nữ trong năm 1993, v&agrave; 12% v&agrave; 17% ở năm 2003.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LEpUdUY9jov81wxzB63lusfNgIf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>C&acirc;u 3: </strong>Ng&agrave;nh <strong>agriculture</strong> c&oacute; nhiều nam hơn hẳn v&agrave;o năm 1993, với 38% lao động nam so với 8% lao động nữ, v&agrave; ở năm 2003, tỷ lệ phần trăm trở n&ecirc;n c&acirc;n bằng hơn, giảm c&ograve;n khoảng 7% cho cả 2 giới.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IHSrd21vEoyWCVxL323lTf62gbf\">\n<div>\n<h4><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>BODY 2: Những ng&agrave;nh c&ograve;n lại:</strong></span></h4>\n<div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QteFdKpejoydDzxgtsElXXkwgsb\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>C&acirc;u 1:</strong> Ng&agrave;nh <strong>business</strong> kh&ocirc;ng đ&aacute;ng kể v&agrave;o năm 1993, cung cấp việc l&agrave;m cho 7% nam v&agrave; gần như kh&ocirc;ng c&oacute; nữ, nhưng qua 10 năm, ng&agrave;nh n&agrave;y trở n&ecirc;n phổ biến hơn, tăng l&ecirc;n 25% ở cả 2 giới.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-K2N6d2Dg0oJSjxxYJFAl8pZBgLb\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>C&acirc;u 2:</strong> Tương tự, ng&agrave;nh <strong>building</strong> kh&ocirc;ng c&oacute; nữ ở năm 1993, nhưng sau đ&oacute; tỷ lệ tham gia của họ tăng l&ecirc;n 6%, trong khi đ&oacute; phần trăm của nam trong ng&agrave;nh n&agrave;y giảm nhẹ từ 12% c&ograve;n 10%.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HRXgdLQ2Yo2Gzsx9Ac9lEgi7gIg\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>C&acirc;u 3: </strong>Ng&agrave;nh <strong>social services </strong>trở n&ecirc;n quan trọng hơn, bởi số phần trăm tăng từ 13% của nam v&agrave; 5% của nữ l&ecirc;n 18% v&agrave; 9% sau 1 thập kỷ.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FzcsdRMXSoU9ngxhPmbljcEIgZf\">\n<div>\n<div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JLrudDKQVoB78vxXmgzldmNBgLh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>4.</strong><strong> Paraphrasing &amp; Vocabulary:</strong></span></h3>\n<div data-page-id=\"Ood5dTvPNoqnHMxOOrHlbFmOgxf\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GLbhdbCKwovei2xJSsEld7p6gXg\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Ood5dTvPNoqnHMxOOrHlbFmOgxf\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RPvMdqRXDoplk8xtrh1lYqWGgrg\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Ood5dTvPNoqnHMxOOrHlbFmOgxf\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-F2Vtd4Bh5o78qrxglSlljNPXgRh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Ood5dTvPNoqnHMxOOrHlbFmOgxf\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NvcHd0Npxo2wfoxbwOOlTzpDgxe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div>\n<div>Ở b&agrave;i n&agrave;y c&aacute;c từ cần paraphrase nhiều l&agrave;: <strong>lực lượng lao động nam/nữ (trong ng&agrave;nh X)</strong></div>\n<div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ByrZdlZsHoJwdYxi3u7lX3reg9b\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>adj </strong><em>(male / female / both genders') </em><strong>+ workforce / labour force</strong> <strong>/ workers</strong></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JiTndt3ogoZKYIxKqEhlF13wgpf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>adj + participation (in X)</strong></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DHEKdzXV8oDvLpxRGxvl5W3Ogzh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><em>men/women || males/females</em><strong> + working/ employed (in X)</strong></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WZVSd9jLNoNhLOxFvHslHaLNgre\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>working</strong> <em>men/women || males/females</em></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LrGHdnsZXoFtntxEbmYlBYMOgeb\">\n<div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">Một số c&aacute;c từ vựng nổi bật:</div>\n<div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KHyodWgZLoH6ukxhBkmlx3qugAf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>more balanced gender distribution:</strong><strong> </strong>sự ph&acirc;n bố giới t&iacute;nh c&acirc;n bằng hơn</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XYnxdRTF0o162xxt00blA6gzg09\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>provide work for sb: </strong>cung cấp việc l&agrave;m cho ai đ&oacute;</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VgYKdwa8uoIiY8xWN5ilY7Fbgid\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>gain/ decline in popularity:</strong> tăng/ giảm về mức độ phổ biến</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Y6cJdpTVyoeWWSxKkTjlPfYCgjd\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>no female representation: </strong>kh&ocirc;ng c&oacute; nữ</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
